{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/3cd4aaca4b0f9b79db17a3f60f0f1322.poster.avif?t=1748540912\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/3cd4aaca4b0f9b79db17a3f60f0f1322.webm?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/3cd4aaca4b0f9b79db17a3f60f0f1322.mp4?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The year is 2029, and mechanically augmented humans have now been deemed outcasts, living a life of complete and total segregation from the rest of society. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now an experienced covert operative, Adam Jensen is forced to operate in a world that has grown to despise his kind. Armed with a new arsenal of state-of-the-art weapons and augmentations, he must choose the right approach, along with who to trust, in order to unravel a vast worldwide conspiracy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUMAN 2.0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/a9d7da649596293c044617d3bc4deb08.poster.avif?t=1748540912\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/a9d7da649596293c044617d3bc4deb08.webm?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/a9d7da649596293c044617d3bc4deb08.mp4?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from an array of cutting edge weapons and augmentations, customizing them to fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDWIDE CONSPIRACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/76e9b416522d73723bb346b339771cff.poster.avif?t=1748540912\" width=750 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/76e9b416522d73723bb346b339771cff.webm?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/76e9b416522d73723bb346b339771cff.mp4?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse locations and discover a near future setting where humanity's fate hangs in the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEANINGFUL CHOICES AND CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/5446445c22c5e8eb4075b62ab84d38f9.poster.avif?t=1748540912\" width=750 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/5446445c22c5e8eb4075b62ab84d38f9.webm?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/5446445c22c5e8eb4075b62ab84d38f9.mp4?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the world of Deus Ex, where the decisions you make and the actions you take play a crucial role in determining the game\u2019s outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Deus Ex: Mankind Divided now and receive the following bonus content FREE:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDesperate Measures\u201d extra in-game mission </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Covert Agent Pack (Intruder Gear, Enforcer Gear and Classic Gear + 1 Praxis Kit + 1000 Credits)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"We Are Human Beings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/f7fceeb3a93747d9598b5cee0c9b331b325f2678.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/1acfe329751a7496c16b425e13cd7ab3792e86e1.jpg"},{"name":"Foxiest of the Hounds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/a209e77046f843941d6d7aa092664fd51330edda.jpg"},{"name":"I Never Asked For This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/b5373a705ae4a5f2e9de2a92fbcaf5ab8a26963b.jpg"},{"name":"The Supreme Enlightened","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/2369860d55653ca8ed85c202061d9d782ddd5171.jpg"},{"name":"Spokes in Two Wheels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/fe2e79d6a7fe9a13b035b2a1187c05668bfc1092.jpg"},{"name":"He's [Not] Dead, Jim","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/f361f10021fc3594c02b4967a3d4db7a9de40da6.jpg"},{"name":"Laputan Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/1de6781b447afbdedea5ef381344c1ceaee54a7d.jpg"},{"name":"A Heated Combination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/ee55f0152a34d0992377634b88ed4edc97f1ae23.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/337000/d2452d961a315923ade99ac1272c8a762325f8eb.jpg"}],"total":81},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/337000?t=1748540912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/337000?t=1748540912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748540912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748540912","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/3cd4aaca4b0f9b79db17a3f60f0f1322.poster.avif?t=1748540912\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/3cd4aaca4b0f9b79db17a3f60f0f1322.webm?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/3cd4aaca4b0f9b79db17a3f60f0f1322.mp4?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The year is 2029, and mechanically augmented humans have now been deemed outcasts, living a life of complete and total segregation from the rest of society. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now an experienced covert operative, Adam Jensen is forced to operate in a world that has grown to despise his kind. Armed with a new arsenal of state-of-the-art weapons and augmentations, he must choose the right approach, along with who to trust, in order to unravel a vast worldwide conspiracy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUMAN 2.0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/a9d7da649596293c044617d3bc4deb08.poster.avif?t=1748540912\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/a9d7da649596293c044617d3bc4deb08.webm?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/a9d7da649596293c044617d3bc4deb08.mp4?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from an array of cutting edge weapons and augmentations, customizing them to fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDWIDE CONSPIRACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/76e9b416522d73723bb346b339771cff.poster.avif?t=1748540912\" width=750 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/76e9b416522d73723bb346b339771cff.webm?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/76e9b416522d73723bb346b339771cff.mp4?t=1748540912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse locations and discover a near future setting where humanity's fate hangs in the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEANINGFUL CHOICES AND CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><sp